    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vītĭcŭla</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vītĕc-</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 1,
			24, 4</span></i>), ae, f.
		dim.
		vitis. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A little vine</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 35, 86</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tert. Carm. adv. Marc.
				2, 230</span></i>; Val. <i><span class="en">Cat. Dir. 11,
			5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A tendril</i>, in gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fruticis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 11, 58, § 98</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cucumeris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 4, 9, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
